2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/226223913/beatriz_pereira-de_alvim
2 CONT
2 CONT Beatriz Pereira de Alvim was a Portuguese noblewoman, the only child of Nuno Álvares Pereira and his wife Leonor de Alvim. On November 8, 1401, she married Afonso, Count of Barcelos, illegitimate son of King João I of Portugal. Sh
2 CONC e died of childbirth before her husband became Duke of Braganza.
