1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Henrique Henriques de Noronha.  
2 CONT * Nobiliário da Ilha da Madeira.  
2 CONT * (Carvalho Paes), pág. 8-verso;  
2 CONT * (Barros), pág. 78-verso;  
2 CONT * (Homem de Sousa), pág. 87 
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Catalina de Barros Goncalves [LDMN-PMY], who was born in Funchal, Madeira, in 1426.  Catalina de Barros Goncalves was married to
2 CONT === Lope Vas Delgado===
2 CONT  [LHHD-MDX] sometime before 1449.  Lope Vas Delgado was the son of Vasco Delgado [L7JW-TG8].  Vasco Delgado was also one of the first settlers in Funchal. [Family Search has Vasco Delgado as married to Francisca Abreu ); (L7JW-TGD
2 CONC ).]  Vasco Delgado was a relative of Tristan Vaz, who discovered the Island of Madeira
2 CONT
2 CONT  "History of the Barrios Family," by Alfred Joseph Barrios, Marie Barrios Caballero, and a genealogist in the Canary Islands, Spain, Copyright 1977, Certificate No. A-887777, Pages 14 - 74.
