0 @N6000000002322298941@ NOTE His military victory in the historic Battle of Aljubarrota (Aug 14 1385) over
1 CONT Castilian forces assured his nation's independence. Earlier brilliant and
1 CONT heroic actions as a field commander won him the office of Constable of the
1 CONT kingdom in 1384 after the Battle of Atoleiros (Apr 06 1384) where he defeated
1 CONT the Castilians. Peace with the Castilians was finally recognized in October
1 CONT of 1411. John I of Portugal rewarded him with titles and extensive lands and
1 CONT property, and Nuno's daughter married John's bastard son, Alfonso.
